---
const snippet = `composer require nicebear/nicebear-php

$nb = new \\NiceBear\\Client('https://api.nicebear.dev', 'nb_live_...');
echo $nb->avatarUrl('av_123', 'john'), "\\n";
$av = $nb->createAvatar([
    'type' => 'generated',
    'engine' => 'minimal',
]);
echo $av['id'], "\\n";`;
---

<html lang="en">
  <head><meta charset="utf-8" /><title>PHP SDK — NiceBear</title></head>
  <body><main>
    <h1>PHP SDK</h1>
    <p>PHP 8.1+ with ext-curl. Source: <code>packages/sdk-php</code>. Errors throw <code>\NiceBear\ApiError</code> with status + body.</p>
    <pre><code>{snippet}</code></pre>
  </main></body>
</html>
